"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap outcome-hero split\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/#solutions\">← Explore solutions</a><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">The worker app</p><h1 class=\"display outcome-title\">Let workers manage<br><span class=\"text-blue\">their own credentials.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Put personal evidence in their hands. Give people a place for their qualifications and certificates, and connect what they share to the records your company manages.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#demo\">See the worker app <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"link\" href=\"#hold\">See how it works ↓</a></div><p class=\"text-sm text-slate\">For the people doing the work and the teams supporting them.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Put personal credentials with the person</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"phone\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-5 h-1.5 w-12 rounded-full bg-ink\"></div><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Jamie’s personal credentials</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold\">Keep your evidence<br>close to hand.</h3><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Manual handling</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Certificate · 30 Nov 2026</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Personal</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">First aid</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">Certificate · 12 May 2027</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Personal</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 border-t-2 border-blue pt-4 text-sm text-slate\">Share the credentials needed for work.</p><div class=\"mx-auto mt-5 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-ink\"></div></div></div></figure></section><nav aria-label=\"On this page\" class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 border-y border-line bg-white\"><div class=\"wrap outcome-nav\"><a href=\"#hold\" data-chapter-link=\"hold\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">01</span>Hold credentials</a><a href=\"#connect\" data-chapter-link=\"connect\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">02</span>Connect records</a><a href=\"#renew\" data-chapter-link=\"renew\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs\">03</span>Keep them current</a></div></nav><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"hold\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Hold personal credentials</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Give workers a place<br>for their own evidence.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Workers keep personal qualifications and certificates in the app. When your team requests evidence, the person has a clear place to start.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">The worker contributes their evidence. Your company decides whether it meets the relevant requirement.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Follow the personal credential</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><ol class=\"sheet flex flex-col gap-7\"><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">01</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Keep the credential</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Store the personal certificate with the person.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">02</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Share for work</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Provide the evidence the organisation needs.</p></li><li class=\"point\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">03</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 text-lg font-semibold\">Keep it current</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Add replacement evidence when the credential changes.</p></li></ol></div></figure></section><section id=\"connect\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / Connect the company view</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Keep personal credentials<br>and company records distinct.</h2><p class=\"copy\">A worker’s qualification and your site induction serve different purposes. Connect both to the person while keeping clear who holds the record and what your team needs to review.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">The company view brings together company-held records and the personal evidence shared for work.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Make ownership clear</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore record ownership\"><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-owner=\"personal\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Person’s credentials</button><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-owner=\"company\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Company records</button></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-line pt-5\"><p id=\"owner-label\" class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Held by the person</p><h3 id=\"owner-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold\">Manual handling certificate</h3><p id=\"owner-copy\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate\">Jamie keeps this personal credential in the app and shares the evidence needed for work.</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Your team’s responsibility</p><p id=\"owner-review\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Review the shared evidence against the role’s requirements.</p></div></div><p id=\"owner-announcement\" role=\"status\" class=\"sr-only\"></p></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"renew\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">03 / Keep the evidence useful</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring updated evidence<br>back into the review.</h2><p class=\"copy\">When a credential changes, connect the replacement evidence to the relevant requirement. Give your team the context to review it and keep the recorded dates current.</p><p class=\"border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm text-slate\">Keep the worker’s contribution and the company’s review visible as separate steps.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/platform/records/\">Explore the renewal journey <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A record that stays useful</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"pt-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Manual handling</h3><span class=\"badge bg-cream text-amber\">Due for renewal</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate\">Expiry date: 30 November 2026</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-8 border-t-2 border-blue pt-6\"><span class=\"absolute -top-2 right-[22%] h-3.5 w-3.5 border-[3px] border-white bg-blue\"></span><div class=\"flex justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate\"><p>Added to record</p><p class=\"text-right font-semibold text-amber\">Renewal approaching</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-line pt-5\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">The next action is visible</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">Arrange renewal and review the new evidence.</p></div></div></div></figure></section><section class=\"split py-12 md:py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Keep the work connected</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Follow the person into the workplace.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3\"><p class=\"copy\">Connect the record to the moments people arrive on site and leave at the end of a visit.</p><a class=\"link\" href=\"/outcomes/verified-worker-check-in/\">Explore site check-in <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a><a class=\"link text-sm\" href=\"/\">Explore the full Certifyd story →</a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">Bring your workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring a credential.<br>Follow both sides.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">We’ll walk through the worker’s view and the company’s requirements, including how personal evidence connects to the review your team carries out.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a worker-app demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/75\">A 20-minute conversation with the Certifyd team.</p></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
